      "description": "A young woman with light skin, blonde hair tied back, wearing a white off-the-shoulder t-shirt with a graphic design and a beaded necklace, is sitting on the grass, holding a hand drum (bongo or djembe-style) in her lap, looking slightly downward with a neutral or pensive expression.",
