      "description": "The target community is white settlers, specifically those accused of cultural appropriation and moral bankruptcy for using other cultures to fill an 'empty soul'. The meme is designed to provoke anger or shame in this group by framing their cultural engagement as inherently flawed and morally bankrupt, rooted in settler colonialism and decolonial theory.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
